o. The time had come, the King Dragon thought. He would raise the girl to become a noble hero like her father.\n\n\u2014Even if she has to defeat him one day.", "summary": "This game is an RPG starring the human child Yuu, who longs to become a \"hero,\" and the dragon \"Overlord\" who fosters her.", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/the-cruel-king-and-the-great-hero", "videos": [{"id": 46206, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "uiIIA0Xla10", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uiIIA0Xla10", "title": "\u300e\u308f\u308b\u3044\u738b\u69d8\u3068\u308a\u3063\u3071\u306a\u52c7\u8005\u300f\u30c6\u30a3\u30b6\u30fc\u30e0\u30fc\u30d3\u30fc", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/uiIIA0Xla10/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 13669, "name": "Picture Book Series"}]}